This is a rapidly declining section about 95% developed. Housing principally lower grade Italian families. Land slopes steeply to east, west and south. Housing is of mixed character and in poor condition except in James Street, where are located several large apartments and a number of large houses remodeled into small units. Employment centers are convenient. Neighborhood is congested. Age, population and location combine to give section a low third-class rating. Typical Sales: |Address| Type of Property| Sales Price and Terms| Remarks| (
